详细说明:
This study includes patients (n=30) and healthy volunteers (n=30).

At inclusion visit, participants have:

* a psychiatric evaluation;
* self evaluation of: empathy, self-compassion, émotionnel processing, anxiety, insight, perceptual aberration and quality of life;
* training to practise of self-compassion and empathy (for patients only).

During the phase of experimentation, the participants have electroencephalogram exams during a rest phase, a self-compasion task and an empathy task.

