* Diabetes mellitus
* History of tuberculosis
* Glaucoma
* Previous corticosteroid-induced myopathy
* Liver failure or cirrhosis
* Renal insufficiency
* Active epilepsy
* Peptic ulceration
* Fresh intestinal anastomoses
