Exclusion Criteria:

1. Uncorrectable moderate or severe hearing or vision deficits;
2. Parkinson's disease;
3. Cancer pain;
4. Chronic pain conditions, such as rheumatoid arthritis, fibromyalgia, or severe low back pain;
